  m_text: "Follow these steps:\n\n1. Ask your question in one of two ways:\n    a.)
    Type it: Click on the \"What's your question?\" section to bring up a virtual
    keyboard and enter your question.\n    b.) Record it: Click the \"Record\" button
    and speak your question. You\u2019ll have 10 seconds\u2014do not press any other
    buttons until the time is up.\n3. Once you're happy with your question, click
    \"Submit\" to send it.\n4. The response will appear below.\n5. Repeat and enjoy
    the conversation!"
